      ":question/id": "495c79b5-4c34-5647-a542-ae6cf191f894",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}3 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 4 & 8\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce $M$ to row echelon form.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Reducing $M$ to row echelon form using the standard algorithm for Gaussian elimination, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}3 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 4 & 8\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{3}{R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -\\frac{2}{3} & \\frac{4}{3} \\\\ 6 & 4 & 8\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-6{R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -\\frac{2}{3} & \\frac{4}{3} \\\\ 0 & 8 & 0\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :=\\frac{1}{8}{R}_{2} \\\\  & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -\\frac{2}{3} & \\frac{4}{3} \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
